Description: MongoDB 7.0.43 server built for ARMv8.0-A (Raspberry Pi 4)
 Upstream mongod from tag r7.0.43, compiled with -march=armv8-a and
 outline atomics so that it runs on the Pi 4's Cortex-A72, which every
 upstream arm64 build since 4.4.19 refuses. Loopback-only by default; it
 exists to back the Omada controller on rr-omr. See PROVENANCE.

