Description: Omada controller host: compose stack, unit, host values
 The TP-Link Omada software controller as a docker compose stack on a
 Raspberry Pi 4 (rr-omr), with its MongoDB outside the container
 (rr-mongodb-server). Ships the stack definition, a oneshot unit whose start
 and reload are 'compose up -d', and /etc/default/rr-omada for the host's data
 paths and uid. An upgrade reloads the unit and recreates the container only
 when the rendered config changed. Carries no credentials.

